    "detail": {
      "id": 1000992,
      "name": "Flawless Plumage",
      "desc": "Nangong Yu has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Lazy Spotlight]</color>.\n[Lazy Spotlight]: When <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: The Unbearable Weight of Love</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Adorable Explosive Impact</color> hits an enemy, the enemy's All-Attribute RES decreases by 18% for 40s. Repeated triggers refresh the duration. When entering the battlefield, Nangong Yu's <color=#FFFFFF>Downbeat</color> is restored to the maximum. In Investigation Zone Mode, this effect can trigger once every 180s.",
      "desc2": "There's no such thing as a flawless genius idol, or wings of pure white.\nBut at least for this one moment, I'll deliver the perfect delusions.",
      "class": {
        "31": "MEDAL"
      },
